---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Blog &bull; Zephyr — Notes &amp; Guides
bodyClass: page--blog
pageId: blog-index
noMarkdownWrapper: true
description: 'Technical notes, desktop setup guides, and development walkthroughs by Zephyr.'
---

<div class="blog-page">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <span class="page-intro__eyebrow">// WRITING &amp; NOTES</span>
    <h1 class="page-intro__title">Technical Blog &amp; Guides</h1>
    <p class="page-intro__desc">
      Documentation, setup walkthroughs, and personal notes on system configuration, development workflows, and software tooling.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="blog-list">
    {% for post in collections.blogpost | reverse %}
      <article class="project-card">
        <div class="project-card__header">
          <span class="project-card__tag">Technical Guide</span>
          <span class="project-card__status">{{ post.date | formatDate if post.date else 'Recent' }}</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="project-card__title">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        </h2>

        <p class="project-card__desc">
          {{ post.data.description }}
        </p>

        <div class="project-card__footer">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="project-card__action">
            Read Article
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>